  "bodyHash": "UlHj92CcuLM=",
  "content": "<h2>功能特性</h2><h3>方块/物品</h3><p>以下方块/物品已统一，可在相关模组的所有工艺流程和配方中通用。</p><p>模组优先级按下文配置部分设定，低优先级模组的物品将在JEI/REI/EMI中隐藏。</p><ul>\n<li><strong>焦煤粉</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersiveengineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸工程</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>所有仿制方块</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopycats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：仿制+</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：连接</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-dreams-and-desires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CD&amp;D</a></li>\n<li><strong>塑料板</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">气动工艺</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>六向齿轮箱</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：连接</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-utilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力实用设备</a></li>\n</ul><h3>流体</h3><p>以下流体已统一，可在相关模组的所有工艺流程和配方中通用。</p><ul>\n<li><strong>原油</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">登星</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-diesel-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CDG</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-love-war\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">C:L&amp;W</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdestroy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">毁灭</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">气动工艺</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>燃料</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">登星</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC&amp;A</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-diesel-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CDG</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-steam-n-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSnR</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdestroy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">毁灭</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-garnished\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：点缀</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">气动工艺</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a><ul>\n<li>其他模组的燃料在登星火箭中的兼容性可通过启用本模组内含的数据包来禁用。</li>\n<li>目前仅TFMG的燃料可在其发电机中使用，因为TFMG不支持自定义燃料类型。（<em>可能会找到变通方案。</em>）</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>煤油、熔融/液态塑料、润滑剂/润滑油</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">气动工艺</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n</ul><h2>安装说明</h2><p>本模组目前仅支持1.20.1和1.21.1版本的(neo)forge。Fabric/Quilt版本即将推出。</p><p>必须安装<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falmost-unified\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almost Unified</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d757\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ddEBPlA.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting (官方合作伙伴) - 使用优惠码 AMRONOS\">\n</a></p><p>Modrinth链接：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddoncompatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/createaddoncompatibility</a></p><h2>兼容性配置</h2><p>要更改兼容性中哪个模组具有优先级，请修改<code>config/almostunified/unify.json</code>中的<code>modPriorities</code>，更多信息请查看<a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/almostunified/wiki/Unification-Config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p><p>默认优先级从高到低为：</p><pre><code>pneumaticcraft\ncopycats\ncreate_connected\ncreate_dd\ntfmg</code></pre><p><br></p><p>本模组内含多个数据包，可用于调整不同模组间的兼容性设置。</p><p>可在创建世界时启用，或使用<code>/datapack enable</code>命令启用。</p><h2>建议/更多兼容功能</h2><p>我已规划更多兼容功能，但如果您有任何想法，欢迎在GitHub提交issue或在Discord服务器中告知我。</p><h2>致谢</h2><p>感谢：</p><ol>\n<li>为本模组提供兼容性的各个模组的创作者。</li>\n<li>AlmostReliable团队开发Almost Unified模组，没有它本模组的制作将极为困难。</li>\n</ol>",
